<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">

<meta name="viewport"
      content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>
Mr. Rime Pokémon GO Guide — Stats, Max CP, Moves, IVs, Shiny, Shadow & More
</title>

<meta name="description"
      content="Complete Mr. Rime Pokémon GO guide covering regular, shiny, shadow, purified, lucky, 100% IV, XXL and XXS Mr. Rime, including stats, max CP, moves, weaknesses, resistances, PvP, raids, IVs, evolution and availability.">

<meta name="robots"
      content="index, follow">

<link rel="canonical"
      href="https://pokemongaming.in/pokemon/mr-rime.html">


<style>

/* =========================================================
   ROOT
========================================================= */

:root {

    --bg: #080b12;
    --bg-soft: #0e131d;

    --surface: #121925;
    --surface-2: #171f2d;
    --surface-3: #202a3b;

    --border: #293448;

    --text: #f4f6fb;
    --muted: #aab3c2;

    --accent: #72d6dc;
    --accent-2: #4e9dff;

    --ice: #72d6dc;
    --psychic: #d06cff;

    --shadow: #555b70;
    --lucky: #f4c542;
    --purified: #b9d7ff;

    --danger: #ff6f7d;
    --success: #62d89a;

    --radius: 18px;
    --radius-sm: 12px;

    --max: 1200px;
}


/* =========================================================
   RESET
========================================================= */

* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
}

html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {

    font-family:
        Inter,
        system-ui,
        -apple-system,
        BlinkMacSystemFont,
        "Segoe UI",
        sans-serif;

    background:

        radial-gradient(
            circle at 80% 0%,
            rgba(114,214,220,.11),
            transparent 30%
        ),

        radial-gradient(
            circle at 10% 20%,
            rgba(208,108,255,.06),
            transparent 30%
        ),

        var(--bg);

    color: var(--text);

    line-height: 1.7;
}

img {
    max-width: 100%;
    display: block;
}

a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
}

p {
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
}

h1,
h2,
h3,
h4 {
    line-height: 1.25;
}

table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
}


/* =========================================================
   HEADER
========================================================= */

.site-header {

    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;

    background:
        rgba(8,11,18,.93);

    backdrop-filter:
        blur(15px);

    border-bottom:
        1px solid var(--border);
}

.header-inner {

    max-width: var(--max);
    margin: auto;

    min-height: 68px;

    padding:
        0 20px;

    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;

    gap: 20px;
}

.logo {

    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 950;
    letter-spacing: -.03em;
}

.logo span {
    color: var(--accent);
}

.main-nav {

    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.main-nav a {

    color: var(--muted);

    font-size: .8rem;

    font-weight: 750;
}

.main-nav a:hover {
    color: white;
}


/* =========================================================
   PAGE
========================================================= */

.page {

    max-width: var(--max);

    margin: auto;

    padding:
        35px 20px 80px;
}


/* =========================================================
   BREADCRUMB
========================================================= */

.breadcrumb {

    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;

    gap: 8px;

    margin-bottom: 25px;

    color: var(--muted);

    font-size: .72rem;
}

.breadcrumb a:hover {
    color: white;
}

.breadcrumb span {
    opacity: .5;
}


/* =========================================================
   HERO
========================================================= */

.pokemon-hero {

    position: relative;

    overflow: hidden;

    padding: 34px;

    border:
        1px solid var(--border);

    border-radius: 26px;

    background:

        radial-gradient(
            circle at 85% 20%,
            rgba(114,214,220,.18),
            transparent 30%
        ),

        radial-gradient(
            circle at 20% 100%,
            rgba(208,108,255,.10),
            transparent 35%
        ),

        linear-gradient(
            145deg,
            #111827,
            #0c111b
        );

    box-shadow:
        0 25px 70px rgba(0,0,0,.25);
}

.hero-grid {

    display: grid;

    grid-template-columns:
        1.35fr .65fr;

    gap: 30px;

    align-items: center;
}

.eyebrow {

    display: inline-flex;

    padding:
        6px 10px;

    border:
        1px solid var(--border);

    border-radius:
        999px;

    color:
        var(--ice);

    background:
        rgba(114,214,220,.08);

    font-size:
        .68rem;

    font-weight:
        900;

    letter-spacing:
        .08em;

    margin-bottom:
        14px;
}

.pokemon-hero h1 {

    font-size:
        clamp(2.2rem,5vw,4.5rem);

    letter-spacing:
        -.055em;

    margin-bottom:
        12px;
}

.hero-subtitle {

    max-width:
        720px;

    font-size:
        1rem;

    color:
        #c2cad7;
}

.hero-tags {

    display:
        flex;

    flex-wrap:
        wrap;

    gap:
        8px;

    margin-top:
        20px;
}

.tag {

    padding:
        7px 11px;

    border:
        1px solid var(--border);

    border-radius:
        999px;

    background:
        rgba(255,255,255,.035);

    font-size:
        .7rem;

    font-weight:
        800;
}

.ice-tag {
    color: var(--ice);
}

.psychic-tag {
    color: var(--psychic);
}


/* =========================================================
   HERO POKEMON
========================================================= */

.hero-pokemon {

    min-height:
        300px;

    display:
        flex;

    justify-content:
        center;

    align-items:
        center;
}

.pokemon-placeholder {

    width:
        260px;

    height:
        260px;

    display:
        flex;

    align-items:
        center;

    justify-content:
        center;

    border-radius:
        50%;

    background:

        radial-gradient(
            circle,
            rgba(114,214,220,.20),
            transparent 65%
        );

    font-size:
        7rem;

    filter:
        drop-shadow(
            0 20px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.4)
        );
}


/* =========================================================
   QUICK STATS
========================================================= */

.quick-stats {

    display:
        grid;

    grid-template-columns:
        repeat(4,1fr);

    gap:
        12px;

    margin-top:
        18px;
}

.quick-stat {

    padding:
        18px;

    background:
        var(--surface);

    border:
        1px solid var(--border);

    border-radius:
        var(--radius-sm);

    text-align:
        center;
}

.quick-stat strong {

    display:
        block;

    font-size:
        1.25rem;
}

.quick-stat span {

    color:
        var(--muted);

    font-size:
        .68rem;

    font-weight:
        750;
}


/* =========================================================
   LAYOUT
========================================================= */

.content-layout {

    display:
        grid;

    grid-template-columns:
        minmax(0,1fr) 290px;

    gap:
        20px;

    margin-top:
        20px;
}


/* =========================================================
   SECTION
========================================================= */

.section {

    margin-bottom:
        20px;

    padding:
        28px;

    background:
        var(--surface);

    border:
        1px solid var(--border);

    border-radius:
        var(--radius);
}

.section-heading {

    margin-bottom:
        20px;
}

.section h2 {

    font-size:
        clamp(1.45rem,3vw,2rem);

    margin-bottom:
        9px;
}

.section h3 {

    margin:
        22px 0 10px;

    font-size:
        1.05rem;
}


/* =========================================================
   STAT GRID
========================================================= */

.stat-grid {

    display:
        grid;

    grid-template-columns:
        repeat(4,1fr);

    gap:
        10px;
}

.stat-card {

    padding:
        17px;

    background:
        var(--surface-2);

    border:
        1px solid var(--border);

    border-radius:
        var(--radius-sm);
}

.stat-card span {

    display:
        block;

    color:
        var(--muted);

    font-size:
        .64rem;

    font-weight:
        850;

    letter-spacing:
        .04em;
}

.stat-card strong {

    display:
        block;

    margin-top:
        4px;

    font-size:
        1.5rem;
}


/* =========================================================
   TYPE BOX
========================================================= */

.type-box {

    display:
        flex;

    align-items:
        center;

    gap:
        15px;

    padding:
        18px;

    border:
        1px solid rgba(114,214,220,.3);

    background:
        rgba(114,214,220,.06);

    border-radius:
        var(--radius-sm);
}

.type-icon {

    width:
        50px;

    height:
        50px;

    display:
        flex;

    align-items:
        center;

    justify-content:
        center;

    border-radius:
        14px;

    background:
        rgba(114,214,220,.13);

    font-size:
        1.5rem;
}

.type-box strong {
    display: block;
}

.type-box span {

    color:
        var(--ice);

    font-size:
        .75rem;

    font-weight:
        850;
}


/* =========================================================
   EFFECT GRID
========================================================= */

.effect-grid {

    display:
        grid;

    grid-template-columns:
        repeat(3,1fr);

    gap:
        12px;

    margin-top:
        15px;
}

.effect-card {

    padding:
        17px;

    border:
        1px solid var(--border);

    border-radius:
        var(--radius-sm);

    background:
        var(--surface-2);
}

.effect-card .effect-icon {

    font-size:
        1.5rem;

    margin-bottom:
        6px;
}

.effect-card strong {
    display: block;
}

.weakness {
    border-color:
        rgba(255,111,125,.25);
}

.resistance {
    border-color:
        rgba(98,216,154,.25);
}


/* =========================================================
   MOVE TABLE
========================================================= */

.table-wrap {
    overflow-x: auto;
}

.data-table th,
.data-table td {

    padding:
        13px 12px;

    border-bottom:
        1px solid var(--border);

    text-align:
        left;

    font-size:
        .76rem;
}

.data-table th {

    color:
        var(--muted);

    font-size:
        .65rem;

    text-transform:
        uppercase;

    letter-spacing:
        .05em;
}

.move-name {
    font-weight: 850;
}

.move-type {
    color: var(--ice);
    font-weight: 800;
}


/* =========================================================
   BEST MOVE
========================================================= */

.best-move {

    margin-top:
        15px;

    padding:
        18px;

    background:

        linear-gradient(
            135deg,
            rgba(114,214,220,.10),
            rgba(255,255,255,.02)
        );

    border:
        1px solid rgba(114,214,220,.25);

    border-radius:
        var(--radius-sm);
}

.best-move strong {

    display:
        block;

    margin-bottom:
        5px;
}


/* =========================================================
   RATING
========================================================= */

.rating-row {

    display:
        grid;

    grid-template-columns:
        170px 1fr 70px;

    gap:
        15px;

    align-items:
        center;

    padding:
        12px 0;

    border-bottom:
        1px solid var(--border);
}

.rating-row:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
}

.rating-bar {

    height:
        8px;

    background:
        var(--surface-3);

    border-radius:
        99px;

    overflow:
        hidden;
}

.rating-fill {

    height:
        100%;

    width:
        var(--rating);

    background:
        var(--accent);

    border-radius:
        inherit;
}

.rating-value {

    text-align:
        right;

    font-weight:
        900;
}


/* =========================================================
   COMPARISON
========================================================= */

.comparison-table th,
.comparison-table td {

    padding:
        14px;

    border:
        1px solid var(--border);

    font-size:
        .75rem;
}

.comparison-table th {

    background:
        var(--surface-2);

    text-align:
        left;
}


/* =========================================================
   IV
========================================================= */

.iv-grid {

    display:
        grid;

    grid-template-columns:
        repeat(3,1fr);

    gap:
        10px;

    margin-top:
        15px;
}

.iv-card {

    padding:
        17px;

    background:
        var(--surface-2);

    border:
        1px solid var(--border);

    border-radius:
        var(--radius-sm);

    text-align:
        center;
}

.iv-card strong {

    display:
        block;

    font-size:
        1.35rem;
}

.iv-card span {

    color:
        var(--muted);

    font-size:
        .68rem;
}


/* =========================================================
   FORM TREE
========================================================= */

.form-tree {

    display:
        flex;

    align-items:
        center;

    justify-content:
        center;

    gap:
        14px;

    flex-wrap:
        wrap;

    margin:
        20px 0;
}

.form-node {

    padding:
        16px 22px;

    background:
        var(--surface-2);

    border:
        1px solid var(--border);

    border-radius:
        var(--radius-sm);

    text-align:
        center;
}

.form-node strong {
    display: block;
}

.form-node span {

    color:
        var(--muted);

    font-size:
        .68rem;
}

.form-arrow {

    color:
        var(--accent);

    font-size:
        1.4rem;

    font-weight:
        900;
}


/* =========================================================
   CHECKLIST
========================================================= */

.checklist {

    list-style:
        none;

    display:
        grid;

    gap:
        8px;

    margin-top:
        15px;
}

.checklist li {

    padding:
        12px 14px;

    background:
        var(--surface-2);

    border:
        1px solid var(--border);

    border-radius:
        9px;

    color:
        #c8cfda;

    font-size:
        .78rem;
}

.checklist li::before {

    content:
        "✓";

    margin-right:
        8px;

    color:
        var(--success);

    font-weight:
        900;
}


/* =========================================================
   VARIANT CARDS
========================================================= */

.variant-grid {

    display:
        grid;

    grid-template-columns:
        repeat(2,1fr);

    gap:
        15px;

    margin-top:
        20px;
}

.variant-card {

    padding:
        22px;

    border:
        1px solid var(--border);

    border-radius:
        16px;

    background:
        var(--surface-2);
}

.variant-card h3 {

    margin:
        0 0 8px;

    font-size:
        1.1rem;
}

.variant-card p {
    margin-bottom: 0;
}

.variant-icon {

    width:
        48px;

    height:
        48px;

    display:
        grid;

    place-items:
        center;

    border-radius:
        14px;

    margin-bottom:
        12px;

    font-size:
        1.4rem;

    background:
        rgba(255,255,255,.06);
}

.shiny-card {
    border-color:
        rgba(208,108,255,.3);
}

.shadow-card {
    border-color:
        rgba(85,91,112,.5);
}

.purified-card {
    border-color:
        rgba(185,215,255,.35);
}

.lucky-card {
    border-color:
        rgba(244,197,66,.35);
}

.size-card {
    border-color:
        rgba(114,214,220,.3);
}


/* =========================================================
   SPECIAL BADGES
========================================================= */

.special-badge {

    display:
        inline-flex;

    padding:
        6px 10px;

    border-radius:
        999px;

    font-size:
        .65rem;

    font-weight:
        900;

    margin-bottom:
        10px;
}

.badge-shiny {

    background:
        rgba(208,108,255,.12);

    color:
        #e4a7ff;
}

.badge-shadow {

    background:
        rgba(85,91,112,.2);

    color:
        #b8bfd0;
}

.badge-purified {

    background:
        rgba(185,215,255,.12);

    color:
        #c7e2ff;
}

.badge-lucky {

    background:
        rgba(244,197,66,.12);

    color:
        #f4c542;
}

.badge-perfect {

    background:
        rgba(98,216,154,.12);

    color:
        #72e0a4;
}


/* =========================================================
   SIDEBAR
========================================================= */

.sidebar {

    position:
        sticky;

    top:
        88px;

    align-self:
        start;
}

.side-card {

    margin-bottom:
        15px;

    padding:
        20px;

    background:
        var(--surface);

    border:
        1px solid var(--border);

    border-radius:
        var(--radius);
}

.side-card h3 {

    margin:
        0 0 13px;

    font-size:
        .9rem;
}

.side-nav {

    list-style:
        none;

    display:
        grid;

    gap:
        4px;
}

.side-nav a {

    display:
        block;

    padding:
        8px 10px;

    border-radius:
        7px;

    color:
        var(--muted);

    font-size:
        .72rem;

    font-weight:
        700;
}

.side-nav a:hover {

    background:
        var(--surface-2);

    color:
        white;
}

.related-link {

    display:
        block;

    padding:
        10px 0;

    border-bottom:
        1px solid var(--border);

    color:
        var(--muted);

    font-size:
        .75rem;
}

.related-link:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
}

.related-link:hover {
    color: var(--accent);
}


/* =========================================================
   FAQ
========================================================= */

details {

    padding:
        15px 0;

    border-bottom:
        1px solid var(--border);
}

details:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
}

summary {

    cursor:
        pointer;

    font-weight:
        850;

    font-size:
        .82rem;
}

details p {

    margin:
        10px 0 0;

    font-size:
        .78rem;
}


/* =========================================================
   EDITORIAL NOTE
========================================================= */

.editorial-note {

    padding:
        17px;

    margin-top:
        20px;

    background:
        rgba(255,255,255,.025);

    border:
        1px solid var(--border);

    border-radius:
        var(--radius-sm);

    font-size:
        .72rem;
}


/* =========================================================
   FOOTER
========================================================= */

footer {

    border-top:
        1px solid var(--border);

    padding:
        35px 20px;

    background:
        #06090e;
}

.footer-inner {

    max-width:
        var(--max);

    margin:
        auto;

    display:
        flex;

    justify-content:
        space-between;

    gap:
        20px;

    flex-wrap:
        wrap;
}

footer p {

    margin:
        0;

    font-size:
        .72rem;
}


/* =========================================================
   RESPONSIVE
========================================================= */

@media(max-width:950px) {

    .content-layout {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .sidebar {
        position: static;
    }

    .hero-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .hero-pokemon {
        order: -1;
    }

    .stat-grid {
        grid-template-columns:
            repeat(2,1fr);
    }

}


@media(max-width:650px) {

    .page {

        padding:
            22px 13px 60px;
    }

    .pokemon-hero,
    .section {
        padding:
            20px;
    }

    .quick-stats {

        grid-template-columns:
            repeat(2,1fr);
    }

    .effect-grid {

        grid-template-columns:
            1fr;
    }

    .stat-grid {

        grid-template-columns:
            repeat(2,1fr);
    }

    .iv-grid {

        grid-template-columns:
            1fr;
    }

    .variant-grid {

        grid-template-columns:
            1fr;
    }

    .rating-row {

        grid-template-columns:
            1fr;

        gap:
            6px;
    }

    .rating-value {

        text-align:
            left;
    }

    .main-nav {
        display:
            none;
    }

}

</style>

</head>


<body>


<!-- =========================================================
     HEADER
========================================================= -->

<header class="site-header">

<div class="header-inner">

<a href="/" class="logo">
Pokémon<span>Gaming</span>
</a>

<nav class="main-nav">

<a href="/pokemon-types.html">
Types
</a>

<a href="/pokedex.html">
Pokédex
</a>

<a href="/raids/">
Raids
</a>

<a href="/guides/">
Guides
</a>

<a href="/tools/">
Tools
</a>

</nav>

</div>

</header>


<main class="page">


<!-- =========================================================
     BREADCRUMB
========================================================= -->

<div class="breadcrumb">

<a href="/">
Home
</a>

<span>›</span>

<a href="/pokedex.html">
Pokémon Database
</a>

<span>›</span>

<a href="/pokemon-types/ice.html">
Ice Type
</a>

<span>›</span>

<strong>
Mr. Rime
</strong>

</div>


<!-- =========================================================
     HERO
========================================================= -->

<section class="pokemon-hero">

<div class="hero-grid">


<div>

<span class="eyebrow">
POKÉMON #866
</span>

<h1>
Mr. Rime
</h1>

<p class="hero-subtitle">

Mr. Rime is an Ice and Psychic-type Pokémon
from the Galar region. In Pokémon GO, it is
known for its unusual dual typing, access to
Ice and Psychic attacks, and its evolution from
Galarian Mr. Mime.

</p>


<div class="hero-tags">

<span class="tag ice-tag">
Ice
</span>

<span class="tag psychic-tag">
Psychic
</span>

<span class="tag">
#866
</span>

<span class="tag">
Galar
</span>

<span class="tag">
Shiny Available
</span>

<span class="tag">
Shadow Available
</span>

</div>

</div>


<div class="hero-pokemon">

<div class="pokemon-placeholder">
🎩
</div>

</div>


</div>

</section>


