========================================================= -->

<section class="section" id="overview">

<div class="section-heading">

<h2>
Mr. Rime Overview
</h2>

<p>

Mr. Rime is the evolved form of Galarian Mr. Mime
and belongs to the Ice/Psychic family. Its typing
gives it access to useful resistances but also leaves
it vulnerable to several common attacking types.

</p>

</div>


