<h3>
Why Mr. Rime's Typing Matters
</h3>

<p>

Mr. Rime's Ice/Psychic combination gives it
resistance to Ice and Psychic attacks. However,
the dual typing also creates several weaknesses,
including Bug, Dark, Fire, Ghost, Rock and Steel.

</p>

</section>


