<h3>
Should You Power Up Mr. Rime?
</h3>

<p>

Mr. Rime is more attractive to collectors and players
who enjoy its Ice/Psychic identity than to players
looking for the absolute strongest raid attacker.
Before investing heavily, compare it with your current
Ice and Psychic teams.

</p>

</section>


