</span>

</div>

</div>


<div class="editorial-note">

<strong>
Important:
</strong>

<p>

When building your Pokédex database, distinguish
Galarian Mr. Mime from regular Mr. Mime because
Mr. Rime's evolution line comes from the Galarian form.

</p>

</div>

</section>


