========================================================= -->

<section class="section" id="shiny">

<div class="section-heading">

<h2>
Shiny Mr. Rime
</h2>

<p>

Shiny Mr. Rime is available in Pokémon GO. The Shiny
variant has an alternate coloration compared with
the standard form.

</p>

</div>


<div class="variant-card shiny-card">

<span class="special-badge badge-shiny">
✨ SHINY
</span>

<div class="variant-icon">
✨
</div>

<h3>
Shiny Mr. Rime
</h3>

<p>

A Shiny Mr. Rime is primarily a collectible variant.
Its Shiny status does not change its basic Ice/Psychic
typing.

</p>

</div>


<h3>
Shiny Mr. Rime Checklist
</h3>

<ul class="checklist">

<li>
Shiny Mr. Rime retains Ice/Psychic typing.
</li>

<li>
Shiny status does not automatically increase battle stats.
</li>

<li>
A Shiny can still have excellent or poor IVs.
</li>

<li>
A Shiny Mr. Rime can also be Lucky if obtained through a trade.
</li>

</ul>

</section>


