<h3>
Shadow Mr. Rime Weaknesses
</h3>

<p>

Shadow status does not change Mr. Rime's basic
Ice/Psychic typing. Its primary type weaknesses
therefore remain Bug, Dark, Fire, Ghost, Rock and Steel.

</p>


<h3>
Should You Power Up Shadow Mr. Rime?
</h3>

<ul class="checklist">

<li>
Check the IVs before spending Stardust.
</li>

<li>
Consider its moveset and intended battle role.
</li>

<li>
Compare its damage output with regular Mr. Rime.
</li>

<li>
Do not automatically purify a strong Shadow Pokémon.
</li>

<li>
Consider the Stardust and Candy cost of Shadow investment.
</li>

</ul>

</section>


